          kind: "report",
          group: "description ownership",
          from: ":: c\n%% note\nmore\n",
          to: "",
          meaning02: "<dl>\n  <dt>c</dt>\n</dl>\n<p>more</p> The comment-only line is not seen (C2-B-137), and `more`, which is not indented past the term mark, ends the term (C2-B-234), so the visible HTML is the 0.1 HTML.",
          toolEntry: "U-379",
