          meaning02: '<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">\n  <p class="div-label">%% hidden</p>\n  <p>body</p>\n</aside> The bracketed div label keeps its comment marker as text under C2-I-023 and C2-B-225. Report the source range from the bracketed label on the div opener.',
          toolEntry: "U-380",
